[SOURCE_PAYLOAD]
{"id":"cue-0-0","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","text":"一年只给你180万"}
{"id":"cue-1-1480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","text":"然而陪伴你的只有孤独和无数的鱼儿"}
{"id":"cue-2-3680","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","text":"在这里任何东西只要敢丢下去"}
{"id":"cue-3-5600","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","text":"都会被巨龙的鱼群瞬间抢光"}
{"id":"cue-4-7660","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-7660","text":"在这与世格觉得钻景平台上"}
{"id":"cue-5-9600","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-7660","text":"钓鱼将是你唯一的乐趣"}
{"id":"cue-6-11080","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-7660","text":"或者是能和同事们一起扔着烂白菜看鱼儿发呆"}
{"id":"cue-7-13860","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-7660","text":"特别是到了晚上"}
{"id":"cue-8-14940","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-7660","text":"无尽的寂寞包裹着你"}
{"id":"cue-9-16440","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-16440","text":"就连扔出去的苹果都被黑暗瞬间吞没"}
{"id":"cue-10-18880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-16440","text":"孤独感预加强烈"}
{"id":"cue-11-19980","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-16440","text":"好歹伙是每天四顿供应"}
{"id":"cue-12-21660","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-16440","text":"健身娱乐样要集权"}
{"id":"cue-13-22940","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-22940","text":"还有网吧游戏和迷你小酒吧"}
{"id":"cue-14-24780","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-22940","text":"而一个月才来一次的直升飞机"}
{"id":"cue-15-26740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-22940","text":"结局按上指休息四天"}
{"id":"cue-16-28260","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-22940","text":"很多人都坚持不了"}
{"id":"cue-17-29480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-22940","text":"也只有每个月准时到账的十来万"}
{"id":"cue-18-31500","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-22940","text":"才会稍微开心一点"}
[/SOURCE_PAYLOAD]

